    "Concept selected under user's delegated direction on 2026-11-15. Logical SKIN-16; stable identity skin-117 / index 117.",
    "Legacy IDs and indices 1–102 are preserved.",
    "Shared NEON STAGE design language and inherited control map retained; visual-only tokens/materials.",
    "No APVTS, control IDs, layout geometry, DSP, audio, MIDI, sampler or preset behavior changes.",
    "PNG preview 360x240 and hero 800x450, G1–G4, registry/runtime integration and host validation pending.",
    "Distinct texture.svg, bezel.svg and crest.svg assets are present. PNG preview/hero, G1-G4, runtime registration and host validation remain pending.",
    "Individual approved art direction: Basalt-black surfaces, forged-steel bevels, controlled lava-orange fissure inlays and heat-treated metallic texture. Orange light is confined to fine seams and selected indicators, preserving a dark industrial console.",
